name"}, {"content": "to bring food and pour drinks", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We serve Brazilian coffee here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le06ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mellow ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pleasantly smooth", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The coffee here is mellow.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le06ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le06ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adjectives to Talk About Food and Drink", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about food and drink, you use adjectives.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"strong\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"powerful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mild\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"not strong but not weak\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mellow\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"smooth and light\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rich\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"strong in a pleasing way\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" spicy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hot and full of flavor \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"unique\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"like no other\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dark\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the color is moving toward black\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "The taste of coffee is unique in every country. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Some are mellow and rich, and others are spicy. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Some are strong, and others are mild. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Most espresso is from dark Brazilian coffee beans.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The Present Continuous Tense  vs.  The Present Simple Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<br>You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about: <br>-things in general <br>-things that happen regularly <br>-things that do not change</br>  <br>Form: <span class=\"strong\">subject + verb</span> </br>  <br>You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about: <br>-something that is happening now <br>-something that is happening around now (today)<br> <br>Form : <span class=\"strong\">subject + to be + verb+<u>ing</span></u>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Simple\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It tastes so good!<br>We love coffee here.<br>The taste of coffee is unique in every country.<br> </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm drinking more coffee here in Brazil. <br>I'm enjoying this coffee. <br>This coffee I'm drinking is strong.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find an English coffee shop's website.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the types of coffee drinks they offer.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose three that you want to try.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write two sentences about each type.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use adjectives to describe the coffee.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences to a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner's sentences.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify different coffee drinks.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a description of different coffee drinks.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss coffee drinks with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}]}